### HIGH: coderabbit (coderabbitai[bot])
**File**: `includes/Models/ActiveJobRepository.php:500`
_🩺 Stability & Availability_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Stop retrying the same batch after a database write failure.**

When an `UPDATE` returns `false`, its candidate remains stale; with 500 such candidates, the next iteration selects them again forever. Track write failures and break so a later cron run can retry safely.

<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
